. * HYPOTHESIS TEST FOR H3 * (Please adapt according to your needs)
. 
.     * Hypothesis: Men with daughters take on a greater share of household lab
> or (gender role attitudes in practice)
.     * Model: DiD fixed effects regression of share of male labor (within coup
> le) on first_child_female × post
.     * Controls: Fixed effects for individual and year (absorbed), cluster by 
> pid
. 
.     xtset pid syear

Panel variable: pid (unbalanced)
 Time variable: syear, 2000 to 2020, but with gaps
